//! Lookup tables for the Rival 3 Wireless Gen 2.
//!
//! **Generated — do not edit by hand.** Transcribed mechanically from rivalcfg
//! (WTFPL) so the values cannot drift through manual copying:
//! `devices/dpi/truemove_air.py`, `handlers/buttons/layout_qwerty.py`,
//! `handlers/buttons/layout_multimedia.py`.

/// TrueMove Air CPI codes, indexed by `dpi / 100 - 1` (100..=18000 DPI, step 100).
///
